ire. Also fixed unvisited doors being incorrectly shown as locked. Passage to the final rooms: these rooms are now connected by a corridor without enemies or traps. A new interactive sign marks the passage. Quality of Life and Fixes Boss reward","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:04:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038884","verified_at":"2026-10-24T08:39:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5089860-1847286114031216","game_id":"steam-5089860","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Mimics, Combat Improvements and Fixes","summary":"Greetings, Wanderers! What's New Mimics arrive in the demo: some coin chests may be hiding a surprise. A chance to escape when surrounded: when your character is cornered and the game detects this situation, an exclamation mark appears above them. At that moment, rolling lets you pass through regular enemies to escape. Walls and obstacles still block your path. New machine dialogue: contextual lines react to the events of your journey. Combat and Economy Revised skill progression, with more noti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:01:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031216","verified_at":"2026-10-22T07:32:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5089860-1847286114027280","game_id":"steam-5089860","kind":"update","title":"The Demo Is Here! Discover Shrines in Our New Update","summary":"Greetings, Wanderers!The Slot Crawler demo went live yesterday as part of Steam Next Fest, and today we’re celebrating with a new update that brings a feature from the full game into the demo: Shrines!Solve the puzzle. Power up your skills.Shrines bring a new challenge to your run: procedurally generated puzzles that activate a skill upgrade bench when solved.{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46307160/a1d24b00698c75efd443f95cff1a59e71cafdbdf.gifBut every attempt matters. Each Shrine starts with a limited numbe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:01:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027280","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:43:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5089860-1845383656393674","game_id":"steam-5089860","kind":"announcement","title":"Slot Crawler Is Coming to Steam Next Fest. Will You Push Your Luck?","summary":"The dungeon wants you dead. The slot machine wants another spin.We’re excited to announce that Slot Crawler is joining Steam Next Fest!Step into a dark pixel art dungeon where your choices and a little luck can turn a promising adventure into glorious chaos.Combine skills and relics, and fight your way through rooms filled with monsters, traps, and treasure. Just remember: not every chest is waiting to reward you. Some are waiting to bite.And then there’s the machine.It has a skull. It has a lev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T14:51:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393674","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:42:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5089860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5089860":"2026-10-26T08:02:30Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5089860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:30Z"},"5332690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:02:30Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5089860","app_id":5089860,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"44f969ce8771590a2ba74a3ccf44cf9af14c1c8be69df847b59af85dd8a8bcfe","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Explore. Kill. Loot. Die. Feed your hard-earned tokens to a slot machine with questionable intentions, then unlock new ways to make terrible decisions on the next run. Slot Crawler is a top-down action roguelike with procedural maps, chaotic builds, and combinations that definitely should not work.","publishers":[{"name":"Disco Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46232568}],"developers":[{"name":"Disco Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46232568}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Slot Crawler Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792500681","trailer_category":2,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5089860/393142459/ddbbfcceda686bb620c5edc1a45d2ae834c092bb/1792434394/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"5089860/393142459/ddbbfcceda686bb620c5edc1a45d2ae834c092bb/1792434394/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"5089860/393142459/ddbbfcceda686bb620c5edc1a45d2ae834c092bb/1792434394/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"5089860/393142459/ddbbfcceda686bb620c5edc1a45d2ae834c092bb/1792434394/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"5089860/393142459/ddbbfcceda686bb620c5edc1a45d2ae834c092bb/1792434394/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257469349/d352da0d3cf61264eee6